OL,3,GNEWSACannabis worth #1.2m seized as two
OL,4,Aarrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cannabis farm worth about #1.2m has
OL,7,Fbeen found during a raid on an
OL,8,Fabandoned factory in Worcestershire.
OL,10,FOfficers stormed the site in an
OL,11,Findustrial estate off Birmingham Road,
OL,12,FKidderminster, on Wednesday as part of
OL,13,Fa day of action across the county.
OL,15,FInside, they found a sophisticated
OL,16,Fset-up across several rooms including
OL,17,Fhydroponics systems and extractor fans.
OL,19,FTwo men, aged 44 and 32, have been
OL,20,Farrested on suspicion of cultivating
OL,21,Fcannabis, West Mercia Police said.
